# Default (unset) = localnet: the "instant demo (burner)" works out of the box
# with a running `solana-test-validator` + deployed program.

# For the real "provision with my wallet" path, point at devnet (the program
# is deployed there) and connect Phantom/Solflare set to devnet:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLUSTER=devnet
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC=https://api.devnet.solana.com

# --- agent brain (/api/agent) ---
# Optional. Server-side Groq key used when a visitor does not bring their own.
# Note: the route is unauthenticated, so a server key can be spent by anyone
# (SECURITY.md L-8). Without it, a scripted brain keeps the demo working.
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b

# --- coordinator persistence ---
# Upstash / Vercel KV REST credentials. Without them the coordinator keeps state
# in memory, which does not survive across serverless instances.
# KV_REST_API_URL=
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# --- coordinator attestation key ---
# base64 PKCS#8 DER ed25519 private key, so ticket attestations are signed by a
# stable key verifiers can pin. Unset = an ephemeral key per process.
# Generate: see docs/UPGRADE-PLAN.md section 4.
# CAPLINE_COORDINATOR_SK=
